    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "They say I'm sharp, like I cut through things, but I just see where it thins."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 28.0,
      "text": "Conversations drift so slow."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.0,
      "end": 34.0,
      "text": "I stretch the light I used to know."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.0,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "They're debating contracts, megabytes, data caps and monthly rights."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 43.0,
      "text": "I'm tracing how the carrier's bend fields that never really end."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "The phase alignment error rates, latency through vacuum states."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "You call it signal, I call it strain of waves collapsing into frame."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 54.0,
      "text": "You hear convenience."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.0,
      "end": 58.0,
      "text": "I hear the cost of distance."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.0,
      "end": 60.0,
      "text": "Dressed up as loss."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.0,
      "end": 64.0,
      "text": "Everything they say feels redshifted."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.0,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "Pulled away elongated gifted."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 72.0,
      "text": "Not wrong."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.0,
      "end": 76.0,
      "text": "Just shifted."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.0,
      "end": 80.0,
      "text": "I'm just shifted further up the scale."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.0,
      "end": 85.0,
      "text": "Where their meanings stretch is thin, mine compresses into detail."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.0,
      "end": 87.0,
      "text": "They think I'm ahead."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.0,
      "end": 89.0,
      "text": "I think the drag behind."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.0,
      "end": 91.0,
      "text": "Same light leaving different miles."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.0,
      "end": 93.0,
      "text": "Just differently align."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 104.0,
      "text": "I explain the plans out loud."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "I'm out probability clouds."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.0,
      "end": 111.0,
      "text": "I see branching in between."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.0,
      "end": 113.0,
      "text": "And trippy in every choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.0,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "Thermal drift and cider voice."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 117.0,
      "text": "You call it simple, I call it course."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.0,
      "end": 119.0,
      "text": "Resolution lost to force."
